{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "diagram_type": "dataflow",
  "meta": {
    "title": "Upgrade Quality Lineage",
    "locale": "en",
    "animation": "trace",
    "visual_preset": "signal-flow",
    "quality_profile": "showcase",
    "viewBox": [1080, 860],
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "scan-gate",
        "label": "Scan then rank",
        "focus": ["scanned-rows", "bulk-scan", "rank-gate", "probe"],
        "note": "Bulk scan compares local_rank. Probe upgradeable is probed_rank > 0 only."
      },
      {
        "id": "download-write",
        "label": "Enqueue to file",
        "focus": ["rank-gate", "enqueue", "dl-item", "music-file"],
        "note": "enqueue_upgrade → _execute_upgrade_job → dl.item → /Volumes/Music."
      },
      {
        "id": "register-play",
        "label": "Register then play",
        "focus": ["music-file", "registry", "scanned-rows", "playback"],
        "note": "Registry writes quality+codec back to scanned. Playback reads the file path."
      }
    ]
  },
  "stages": [
    { "label": "Library" },
    { "label": "Discover" },
    { "label": "Rank gate" },
    { "label": "Download" },
    { "label": "Register + play" }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "scanned-rows",
      "type": "database",
      "label": "scanned rows",
      "sublabel": "SQLite",
      "tag": "quality + codec",
      "stage": 0,
      "row": 1,
      "width": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "bulk-scan",
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "GET /upgrade/scan",
      "sublabel": "_start_bulk_scan",
      "tag": "SSE cache",
      "stage": 1,
      "row": 1,
      "width": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "probe",
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "POST /upgrade/probe",
      "sublabel": "upgradeable: rank>0",
      "tag": "no local_rank",
      "stage": 1,
      "row": 3,
      "width": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "rank-gate",
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "rank compare",
      "sublabel": "local vs TIER_RANK",
      "tag": "24/48 = 3",
      "stage": 2,
      "row": 1,
      "width": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "enqueue",
      "type": "messagebus",
      "label": "enqueue_upgrade",
      "sublabel": "UpgradeJobInput",
      "tag": "job.quality",
      "stage": 3,
      "row": 0,
      "width": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "dl-item",
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "dl.item",
      "sublabel": "skip_existing=False",
      "tag": "redownload",
      "stage": 3,
      "row": 2,
      "width": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "music-file",
      "type": "database",
      "label": "file on disk",
      "sublabel": "/Volumes/Music",
      "tag": "download_base_path",
      "stage": 4,
      "row": 1,
      "width": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "registry",
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "register track",
      "sublabel": "_read_metadata",
      "tag": "writes scanned",
      "stage": 4,
      "row": 3,
      "width": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "playback",
      "type": "frontend",
      "label": "playTrack",
      "sublabel": "GET /playback/local",
      "tag": "path query",
      "stage": 4,
      "row": 0,
      "width": 150
    }
  ],
  "flows": [
    {
      "from": "scanned-rows",
      "to": "bulk-scan",
      "label": "ISRC rows",
      "classification": "upgradeable_tracks",
      "variant": "emphasis",
      "route": "straight",
      "labelAt": [208, 200]
    },
    {
      "from": "bulk-scan",
      "to": "rank-gate",
      "label": "local vs probed",
      "classification": "probed > local",
      "variant": "emphasis",
      "route": "straight",
      "labelAt": [423, 200]
    },
    {
      "from": "probe",
      "to": "rank-gate",
      "label": "max_quality",
      "classification": "flag unused by tab",
      "variant": "dashed"
    },
    {
      "from": "rank-gate",
      "to": "enqueue",
      "label": "UpgradeJob",
      "classification": "track_id + old_path",
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "from": "enqueue",
      "to": "dl-item",
      "label": "upgrade job",
      "classification": "quality enum",
      "variant": "emphasis",
      "route": "straight",
      "labelDy": 24
    },
    {
      "from": "dl-item",
      "to": "music-file",
      "label": "shutil.move",
      "classification": "new path",
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "from": "music-file",
      "to": "registry",
      "label": "_read_metadata",
      "classification": "quality + codec",
      "variant": "emphasis",
      "route": "straight",
      "labelDy": 24
    },
    {
      "from": "music-file",
      "to": "playback",
      "label": "/playback/local",
      "classification": "no new_path hook",
      "variant": "dashed",
      "route": "straight",
      "labelDy": -28
    }
  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Disconnect answers",
      "items": [
        "TRUE: probe.upgradeable is probed_rank > 0 (upgrade.py:346). Upgrades tab uses scan results (player.js:1790,1902), not that flag",
        "PARTIAL: same dl.item; skip_existing=False and job.quality differ from download (download_job_service.py:531-556 vs 757-768)",
        "TRUE write / FALSE refresh: register writes quality+codec (registry.py:23-54). GET /upgrade/scan stays complete-cached (upgrade.py:530-545)",
        "TRUE: GET /upgrade/scan after complete is sticky — Scan Again replays cache (upgrade.py:530-545; player.js:1818-1824)",
        "TRUE: 24/48 FLAC is rank 3; HI_RES_LOSSLESS is rank 4 so it is offered (utils.py:77-80; upgrade.py:165-167,693)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Missing pipes",
      "items": [
        "No reset of _scan_state after complete — DELETE /upgrade/probes does not clear it (upgrade.py:414-426,530-545)",
        "register_downloaded_track does not call playTrack; upgrade_complete only paints the upgrade row (views.js:4091-4092)",
        "upgradeTrack() trusts probe.upgradeable without local_rank (api.js:256-263)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Closed loops",
      "items": [
        "Scanner and registry both write quality/format/codec via _read_metadata (library.py:406-446; registry.py:50-52)",
        "Upgrade start re-checks local_rank vs probed_rank before enqueue (upgrade.py:482-489)",
        "Successful upgrade deletes the ISRC probe so a real rescan would re-probe (download_job_service.py:784-787)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
